 throws.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General","Saving Throw"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"NYz0Xf8a","formula":"2","target":"ref","type":"untyped","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"115, 130"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":612500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.0bZf3SDkvVOe2ujH"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"GFJphKLdxG0LvgNF","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125230623,"modifiedTime":1795125233170,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/power-attack.jpg","name":"Power Attack","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>You can make exceptionally deadly melee attacks by sacrificing accuracy for strength.</i><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Str 13, base attack bonus +1.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You can choose to take a -1 penalty on all melee attack rolls and combat maneuver checks to gain a +2 bonus on all melee damage rolls. This bonus to damage is increased by half (+50%) if you are making an attack with a two-handed weapon, a one handed weapon using two hands, or a primary natural weapon that adds 1-1/2 times your Strength modifier on damage rolls. This bonus to damage is halved (-50%) if you are making an attack with an off-hand weapon or secondary natural weapon. When your base attack bonus reaches +4, and every 4 points thereafter, the penalty increases by -1 and the bonus to damage increases by +2. You must choose to use this feat before making an attack roll, and its effects last until your next turn. The bonus damage does not apply to touch attacks or effects that do not deal hit point damage.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Offensive"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"116, 131"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":812500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.FUW5mIXHNBBIQ1Sq"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"THsInVICo0imnc2d","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125230678,"modifiedTime":1795125233170,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/alertness.jpg","name":"Skill Focus (Perception)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Choose a skill. You are particularly adept at that skill.</em></p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +3 bonus on all checks involving the chosen skill. If you have 10 or more ranks in that skill, this bonus increases to +6.</p><p><strong>Special</strong>: You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new skill.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"azboKqZI","formula":"ifelse(gte(@skills.per.rank,10),6,3)","target":"skill.per","type":"untyped","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":912500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-feats.Item.9yua5ZlomvDj1c7D"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"uqVBByIcTJ0GzErk","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125230740,"modifiedTime":1795125233170,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/weapon-focus.jpg","name":"Weapon Focus (Talons)","system":{"description":{"value":"<i>Choose one type of weapon. You can also choose unarmed strike or grapple (or ray, if you are a spellcaster) as your weapon for the purposes of this feat.</i><p><strong>Prerequisites</strong>: Proficiency with selected weapon, base attack bonus +1.</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You gain a +1 bonus on all attack rolls you make using the selected weapon.</p><p><strong>Special</strong>: You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new type of weapon.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Combat","Weapon","Offensive"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{"weapon-focus":true},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{},"sources":[{"id":"PZO1110","pages":"117, 136"}]},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":1012500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf1.feats.Item.n250dFlbykAIAg5Z"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"cBXAbJ0yBWn8Zeg3","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125231037,"modifiedTime":1795125233170,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"folder":"xPJd6syoxDiunnzG","img":"icons/commodities/claws/claw-bird-yellow.webp","name":"Talon","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A primary natural attack with talons on your feet.</p><p>It deals slashing damage.</p><hr /><p>For general rules on natural attacks, see: @UUID[Compendium.pf1.pf1e-rules.nBnUY0koBzX